  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "下班以后跑一趟  (Running an Errand After Work)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After the Media College student union turns down Qin Xiao's request, Qin Xiao calls Bu Xiaogu into her office to hand off the audience-recruiting errand. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦助理，叫我过来有什么吩咐啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "有个工作任务，我觉得很适合你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "有什么命令直接通过办公系统下达到行政处，我随时奉命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你在学生会不是关系处得挺好的吗？现在盛典项目需要他们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是去找老李，结果被他拒绝了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "参加盛典项目这个机会，可不是天天都有的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "总之你下了班以后回学校跑一趟吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我晚上还有个约会，没那工夫。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你今晚跟谁约会啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于师兄啊，今天晚上我要好好跟他请教节目制作的问题。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦助理，叫我过来有什么吩咐啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assistant Qin, what instructions do you have for me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "有个工作任务，我觉得很适合你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a work assignment that I think suits you very well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "有什么命令直接通过办公系统下达到行政处，我随时奉命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Send any order straight to administration through the office system, and I will carry it out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你在学生会不是关系处得挺好的吗？现在盛典项目需要他们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not get along well with the student union? The gala project needs them now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是去找老李，结果被他拒绝了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you go ask Old Li only to get turned down by him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "参加盛典项目这个机会，可不是天天都有的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A chance to join the Star Night project does not come along every day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "总之你下了班以后回学校跑一趟吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In short, make a trip back to campus after you get off work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我晚上还有个约会，没那工夫。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have an appointment this evening and cannot spare the time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你今晚跟谁约会啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is your appointment with tonight?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于师兄啊，今天晚上我要好好跟他请教节目制作的问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior Chun Yuqiao; tonight I am going to ask his advice on producing shows.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "秦助理，叫我过来有什么吩咐啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
